{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/paid_gate.py | sed -n '20,34p'; rg -n 'STOP|tun' docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-GATE.md | tail -12\"","aggregated_output":"    20\timport threading\n    21\tfrom pathlib import Path\n    22\t\n    23\tHERE = Path(__file__).resolve().parent\n    24\tREPO = HERE.parents[2]\n    25\tsys.path.insert(0, str(HERE))\n    26\tsys.path.insert(0, str(REPO / 'src'))\n    27\timport calc_check as cc                                                 # noqa: E402\n    28\timport calc_small as cs                                                 # noqa: E402\n    29\timport render_v13 as rv                                                 # noqa: E402\n    30\tfrom hivemind import config, model                                      # noqa: E402\n    31\t\n    32\tRUN = REPO / 'poc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run'\n    33\tCONFIG = REPO / 'poc/config/poc-v118.json'                              # its re-judging model setting: gpt-6-luna, medium, 16000 output tokens\n    34\tSYSTEM = (HERE / 'judging-v13-draft.txt').read_text()\n3:**Result (D733): STOP.** All 72 answers were refused, and $0.3677 was spent; see `PAID-GATE-RESULT.md`.\n52:- **Packets:** 27 packets with the arm hidden. The verdict is computed on synthetic readings: both arms good gives STOP (gain under 3);\n53:  a joint gain of 4 gives PASS; one published singleton defect gives STOP; a separate-arm defect alone does not stop; a missing\n274:  - **STOP:** any such published defect; a coverage line missed; a gain under 3.\n282:- **STOP or INCOMPLETE:** the line goes back to Alex with the readings, and nothing is tuned on these 36 answers.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
